---

The bundled map images resources/img/world_day.png and
resources/img/world_night.png are derived from the 200-pixel-wide atlas:
  resources/world~200w~color.png (day rows 0–99; night rows 100–199).
Their visible 200x100 map regions match those upstream pixels exactly.
Each bundled PNG includes a final palette row covered by the watchface HUD.

Source atlas:
  https://github.com/rengianforte/pebble-day-night/blob/master/resources/world~200w~color.png

Upstream project:

  Day and Night Earth Watchface
  Copyright (c) 2025 Ren Gianforte
  https://github.com/rengianforte/pebble-day-night
  MIT License
